			"rendered": "## [0.2.1](https://github.com/canvist/canvist/releases/tag/v0.2.1) (2026-11-06)\n\nGrouped release for `sdk`.\n\n### 🐛 Fixed\n\n- **Remove the unmaintained pin-utils dependency from the HTTP stack.** Update Hyper from 1.8.1 to 1.12.0 within its existing compatible version range. This removes pin-utils, flagged by informational advisory RUSTSEC-2026-0441, without adding a cargo-deny exception.\n  _Packages:_ 🟢 _canvist_dictation_relay_\n  _Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #241](https://github.com/canvist/canvist/pull/241)"
